This directory is a port of the static frontend of hermes-webui:

    https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui
    pin 3d9488fca6bb248c77f988bfbffcca9d8cfd9561
    source path: static/

Files here are copies with the documented patches in
docs/WORKBENCH_UI_PORT.md (§5). Qubit's own additions (the API shim, the
asset route, the rebrand) are original Qubit material under the repository
LICENSE; the frontend layout, CSS and JS remain under the MIT notice above.
